<title>CROATIA: Croatia c.bank details May balance of payments.</title>
<headline>Croatia c.bank details May balance of payments.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Croatia issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA BALANCE OF PAYMENTS    MAY    APRIL   JAN-MAY   MAY'95</p>
<p> Current account (million USD)    -88.7   -169.9   -496.6    -119</p>
<p> Capial and financial account  54.4   -133.7     98.9	42</p>
<p> -Reserve assets		  -43.0     14.5    -57.5     -77</p>
<p> Net errors and omissions	34.3    303.6    397.7	78</p>
<p>-- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
